  "body": "With Its Compact Footprint And Well-Considered Layout, This Home Offers A Fantastic Opportunity To Create A Comfortable Family Home, Rental Property Or Family Bach.\r\n\r\n*Three Bedrooms – Three bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation for families, guests or those wanting additional space for a home office.\r\n*Open-Plan Living – A practical kitchen and dining area flows through to the living room, creating a welcoming space for everyday living.\r\n*Functional Kitchen – Centrally positioned with a convenient layout connecting the dining and living areas.\r\n*Family Bathroom – A separate bathroom and toilet provide added convenience for busy households.\r\n*Separate Laundry – A dedicated laundry space adds to the home’s practical design.\r\n*Tidy Exterior & A Single Piece Shift – Well maintained Fibre-cement cladding that has been tested as asbestos free. Aluminium joinery and long run iron roof give this home a clean, easy-care appearance.\r\n\r\nThe selling price includes:\r\n\r\n*Our Relocation Package onto an easy access flat site within 100kms of its current location\r\n*Standard NZS3604 timber foundations\r\n*GST\r\n\r\nThe final price is subject to a destination site inspection and does not include any council fees.\r\n\r\nPlease call Myles on 022 657 5070 to arrange a time to view or to find out more about purchasing this house for shifting to your section.\r\n\r\n*Please note depending on the level of interest, the sale of this house may go to a multi offer.\r\n\r\n*Do you need help with Consents, Building Plans, Draughting & Design? Our team can help! Give us a call on 0508 4 RELOCATE (473 562) to book a FREE 20-min consultation with our Design Manager for expert advice on your next project.\r\n*Want to know more about the Relocation process? Read our Definitive Guide to Buying a Relocatable House.\r\n*Any other questions? Give us a call on 0508 4 RELOCATE (0508 473 562) to find out how we can help.",
